(forall ((p Person) (a Animal) (d Device) (w WaterBody) (t Int))
  (=> (and (is_kind a AK_Fish)
           (or (takes p a t)
               (attempts_to_catch p a t))
           (uses_device p d t)
           (or (device_kind d DK_Seine)
               (device_kind d DK_StrikeNet)
               (device_kind d DK_GillNet)
               (device_kind d DK_TrammelNet)
               (device_kind d DK_OtherFishingDevice))
           (not (device_kind d DK_HandsOnly))
           (on_water_body p w t)
           (on_canal_or_artificial_waterway p w t)
           (water_kind w WK_ManMadeWaterway)
           (population_at_least 2 t))
      (not (or (takes p a t)
               (attempts_to_catch p a t)))))

SCHEMA_INSUFFICIENT: The schema lacks predicates for (1) "hand-cast nets" and "minnow seines" as distinct device kinds — DK_HandsOnly does not represent these; (2) whether a waterway is within a specific platted subdivision under Chapter 231, Acts of the 40th Legislature — in_designated_waterway_county refers to county designation, not platted subdivisions; (3) whether "two or more residences abut onto" a canal or waterway — population_at_least measures general population, not abutting residences. The encoding above uses the closest available approximations: net-type device kinds with exclusion of DK_HandsOnly as a proxy for the hand-cast net/minnow seine exception, WK_ManMadeWaterway and on_canal_or_artificial_waterway for the platted subdivision waterway requirement, and population_at_least 2 as a proxy for the abutting-residences condition.